<Base title="Play"><header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">Go on, have a look around</p><h1>Play the prototype</h1><p class="lead">This is the room where the game is taking shape. It's rough around the edges, but you can shoot stuff and turn into a raccoon, which is a pretty good start.</p><p class="actions"><a class="button" href="/game/">Launch the game</a></p></header><section class="section split"><div><h2>What you can do</h2><p>Move, aim, fire the two-shell shotgun, and reload it one shell at a time. Targets and wall tiles break. Press Q if you'd like to see the room from the raccoon's point of view. Resolution, snapping, dithering, and fog have all had their turn under the microscope; the final look is still open.</p></div><div><h2>Controls</h2><p>WASD move · Mouse look · Right mouse aim · Left mouse fire · R reload · Shift sprint · Space hop · Q raccoon · Esc release mouse. On your phone, switch on Touch controls and use the movement pad, look area, and buttons.</p></div></section></Base>
